<p>
<pb facs="StadtASG_Missive_2765_10791.jpg" n="1"/>
<lb n="1"/>Unser freündtlich willig dienst und was wir
<lb n="2"/>ehren, liebs und guets vermoegen, zuvor, Frommen,
<lb n="3"/>Fürsichtigen, Ehrsamen und Weÿsen, Jnsonders
<lb n="4"/>gueten Freünden und getreüwen lieben <orgName role="recipient" resp="#ner">Eÿdt-
<lb n="5"/>gnossen</orgName>.
<lb n="6"/>Uns haben unser burger und kauffleüth,
<lb n="7"/>so inn dem beschwerlichen arreststreitt mit
<lb n="8"/><persName resp="#ner"><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Hieronÿmo</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Müller</unclear></persName> auß <placeName ref="stadtasg-places-133" cert="medium" resp="#ner"><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Basel</unclear></placeName>, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Jnteressiert</unclear>
<lb n="9"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">seindt</unclear>, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">gehorsamblich</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">zuverstehen</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">gegeben</unclear>, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">welcher</unclear>
<lb n="10"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">gestalten</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">sie</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">beÿ</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Eüch</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">unsern</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">getreüwen</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">lieben</unclear>
<lb n="11"/><orgName role="recipient" resp="#ner"><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Eÿdtgnossen</unclear></orgName> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Nuenmahr</unclear> deß, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">wie</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">eüch</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">durch</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">ihren</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">anwaldt</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">mündtlich</unclear> mit <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">mehrerem</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">wirdt</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">berichtet</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">werden</unclear>, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">etwas</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">beweißt</unclear>, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">darauff</unclear> die
<lb n="12"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">endtliche</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">erledigung</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">deß</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">hauptstreitts</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">bestehen</unclear>
<lb n="13"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">solle</unclear>, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">auß</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">ihren</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Rhats</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">und</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Grichtsacten</unclear>
<lb n="14"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">uber</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">die</unclear> <placeName resp="#ner"><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Eeger</unclear></placeName>- <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">und</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Züblische</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Fallimentsach</unclear>,
<lb n="15"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">vonnoeten</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">hetten</unclear>, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">mit</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">angehefftem</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">bitten</unclear>,
<lb n="16"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">weilen</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">ihnen</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">hieran</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">nicht</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">wenig</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">gelegen</unclear>, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">sonder</unclear>
<lb n="17"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">die</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">endtliche</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">erledigung</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">deß</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">hauptstreitts</unclear>
<lb n="18"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">darauff</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">bestehen</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">solle</unclear>, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">wir</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">ihnen</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">zu</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">auß</unclear>-
<lb n="19"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">zuezen</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">dselben</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">mit</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">unserer</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">vor</unclear>-
<lb n="20"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">schrifft</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">befündersamb</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">erscheinen</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">wolten</unclear>.
<lb n="21"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Und</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">obwolen</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">wir</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Eüch</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">die</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">warheit</unclear>, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">und</unclear>
<lb n="22"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">zinnal</unclear> auch die <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Justitj</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">ohne</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">daß</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">zubefürdern</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">geneigt</unclear>
<lb n="23"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">wissen</unclear>, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Nichtsdesto</unclear> weniger haben wir
<lb n="24"/>ihnen ihr instendig bitten burgerlicher verwandt-
<lb n="25"/>nuß halber nicht verweigern koennen.
<pb facs="StadtASG_Missive_2765_10792.jpg" n="2"/>
<lb n="26"/>Unnd bitten hiemit Eüch fründtlich und <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Eydt</unclear>-
<lb n="27"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">gnößisch</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Ihr</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">wellet</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">ihnen</unclear> in ihrem begeren guenstige will-
<lb n="28"/>fahr, soviel sich thuon last, erweysen, deß
<lb n="29"/>inn gleiches und <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">andren</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">seindt</unclear> wir <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">hinwiderumb</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">freundtlich</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">zubeschulden</unclear>
<lb n="30"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">occurrentien</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">erbiethig</unclear>; <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">dem</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">allwaltenden</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Gott</unclear>
<lb n="31"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">unß</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">darmit</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">samptlich</unclear> befelchendt. Datum
<lb n="32"/><origDate when="1619" resp="#ner">den xvijen Septembr, Ao 1619</origDate>.
<lb n="33"/><orgName ref="stadtasg-actors-148" cert="medium" role="issuer" resp="#ner">Burgermeister und Rhat
<lb n="34"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">der</unclear> Statt <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Sanct</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Gallen</unclear></orgName>
<lb n="35"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">An</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">die</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Statt</unclear>
<lb n="36"/><orgName ref="stadtasg-actors-28" cert="medium" role="recipient" resp="#ner"><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Schaffhausen</unclear></orgName>.
<pb facs="StadtASG_Missive_2765_10793.jpg" n="3"/>
<lb n="37"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Alß</unclear> dann nach <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">erschollenem</unclear> <placeName ref="stadtasg-places-111" cert="medium" resp="#ner"><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Speyür</unclear></placeName>- <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">und</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Hueberischem</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">falliment</unclear>, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">herr</unclear>
<lb n="38"/><persName resp="#ner"><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Hieronÿmus</unclear> Müller</persName>, burger zuo <placeName ref="stadtasg-places-133" cert="medium" resp="#ner">Basel</placeName>, wegen seiner <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">auff</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">gedachte</unclear>
<lb n="39"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">falliten</unclear> habenden prætension und <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">schuldforderung</unclear>, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">sowol</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">auff</unclear>
<lb n="40"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">etlicher</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">unser</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">burgeren</unclear>, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">alß</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">anderer</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">inn</unclear>- und ußert <orgName ref="stadtasg-actors-750" cert="medium" resp="#ner">Lob: Eÿdgnst
<lb n="41"/>gnoßschafft</orgName> geseßnen kauff- und handlsleüthen guetter, in <placeName ref="stadtasg-places-133" cert="medium" resp="#ner">Lob:
<lb n="42"/>Statt Basell</placeName>, einen <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">unbefuegten</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Arrest</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">legen</unclear>, und <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">solche</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">selbigen</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">orthß</unclear>
<lb n="43"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">verbietten</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">lassen</unclear>, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">durch</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">welche</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">unfreündtliche</unclear> handlung besagte
<lb n="44"/>unser burger und andere Interessierte in langwirige beschwerliche
<lb n="45"/>rechtßüebung verleittet und eingefuehrt worden, die gantze sach
<lb n="46"/>aber, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">ihrem</unclear> fürgeben <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">nach</unclear>, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">darauff</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">beruchet</unclear>, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">dß</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">er</unclear> <persName resp="#ner"><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Müller</unclear></persName>, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">laut</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">deß</unclear>
<lb n="47"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">außgangnen</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">urthls</unclear>, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">fürlegen</unclear> und beweißen soll, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">dß</unclear> er in <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">anforde</unclear>-
<lb n="48"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">rung</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">seiner</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">auff</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">die</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">falliten</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">habenden</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">prætension</unclear>, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">so</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">er</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">vor</unclear> <orgName ref="stadtasg-actors-148" cert="medium" role="recipient" resp="#ner"><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Eüch</unclear>
<lb n="49"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">unsern</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">getrüwen</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Lieben</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Eÿdtgnoßen</unclear></orgName> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">in</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">ewer</unclear> <placeName ref="stadtasg-places-185" cert="medium" resp="#ner"><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Lob</unclear>: <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Statt</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Schafhußen</unclear></placeName>
<lb n="50"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">außgewürckht</unclear>, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">ihme</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">jeniges</unclear>, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">waß</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">er</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">in</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">letster</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Rechnung</unclear> vor
<lb n="51"/>einem <orgName ref="stadtasg-actors-530" cert="medium" resp="#ner"><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Lob</unclear>: <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Stattgricht</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">zuo</unclear> Basel</orgName> eingelegt, an unsern burgern
<lb n="52"/>und anderen Interessenten zeforderen, expressè vorbehalten habe, wormit
<lb n="53"/>dene an solchem bewißthuemb gedacht unsern burgern nit wenig gelegen,
<lb n="54"/>sie <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">auch</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">vor</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">unserm</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">versamleten</unclear> Rath erschinen und underthänig
<lb n="55"/>begert, dß wir ihnen an <orgName role="recipient" resp="#ner">Eüch unsere getrüwe Liebe Eÿdtgnoßen</orgName> ein
<lb n="56"/>Intercession schriben mittheilen welten, damit sie von <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Eüch</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">förderlichst</unclear>
<lb n="57"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">angehört</unclear>, und dann wie über ihr anbringen die sachen beschaffen
<lb n="58"/>ihnen zuo stüwr der warheit schrifftlicher schein mitgetheilt <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">werden</unclear>,
<lb n="59"/>und der gegentheil mit <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">einstreuung</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">ungleichen</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">berichtß</unclear>
<lb n="60"/>nicht aufkhomen möge, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Alß</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">haben</unclear> wir ihr zimlich begeren
<lb n="61"/>angesehen, langt etc.
